    <entry>
      <title>docker的常用命令</title>
      <link href="/2025/11/06/docker-start/"/>
      <url>/2025/11/06/docker-start/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="Docker源的问题"><a href="#Docker源的问题" class="headerlink" title="Docker源的问题"></a>Docker源的问题</h2><blockquote><p>[!WARNING]</p><p>很多国内docker源已经失效，剩下的也不能保证</p></blockquote><p>建议时不时查询一下可用docker源</p><h2 id="创建一个容器"><a href="#创建一个容器" class="headerlink" title="创建一个容器"></a>创建一个容器</h2><ol><li><p>拉取一个镜像</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">docker</span> pull ubuntu<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre></li><li><p>创建并运行容器</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">docker</span> run <span class="token parameter variable">-it</span> <span class="token parameter variable">--name</span> my_container ubuntu<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre></li><li><p>进入容器环境</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">docker</span> <span class="token builtin class-name">exec</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-it</span> my_container /bin/bash<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre></li><li><p>保存容器状态</p><pre class="line-numbers language-none"><code class="language-none">docker commit my_container my_custom_image<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre></li></ol><h2 id="Dockerfile的使用"><a href="#Dockerfile的使用" class="headerlink" title="Dockerfile的使用"></a>Dockerfile的使用</h2><p>如果提供了dockerfile，那么创建环境就方便多了</p><p>示例：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-docker" data-language="docker"><code class="language-docker"><span class="token comment"># 使用基础镜像</span><span class="token instruction"><span class="token keyword">FROM</span> ubuntu</span><span class="token comment"># 安装所需软件</span><span class="token instruction"><span class="token keyword">RUN</span> apt-get update &amp;&amp; apt-get install -y <span class="token operator">\</span>    vim <span class="token operator">\</span>    curl</span><span class="token comment"># 设置工作目录</span><span class="token instruction"><span class="token keyword">WORKDIR</span> /app</span><span class="token comment"># 复制文件到容器</span><span class="token instruction"><span class="token keyword">COPY</span> . /app</span><span class="token comment"># 设置默认命令</span><span class="token instruction"><span class="token keyword">CMD</span> [<span class="token string">"bash"</span>]</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>然后构建：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">docker</span> build <span class="token parameter variable">-t</span> my_custom_image <span class="token builtin class-name">.</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><p>运行：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">docker</span> run <span class="token parameter variable">-it</span> <span class="token parameter variable">--name</span> my_custom_container my_custom_image<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><h3 id="在dockerfile中修改软件源"><a href="#在dockerfile中修改软件源" class="headerlink" title="在dockerfile中修改软件源"></a>在dockerfile中修改软件源</h3><pre class="line-numbers language-docker" data-language="docker"><code class="language-docker"><span class="token instruction"><span class="token keyword">RUN</span> sed -i <span class="token string">'s@//.*archive.ubuntu.com@//mirrors.ustc.edu.cn@g'</span> /etc/apt/sources.list</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><pre class="line-numbers language-docker" data-language="docker"><code class="language-docker"><span class="token instruction"><span class="token keyword">RUN</span> sed -i <span class="token string">'s@//.*archive.ubuntu.com@//mirrors.ustc.edu.cn@g'</span> /etc/apt/sources.list.d/ubuntu.sources</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><h2 id="管理容器"><a href="#管理容器" class="headerlink" title="管理容器"></a>管理容器</h2><h5 id="查看运行中的容器："><a href="#查看运行中的容器：" class="headerlink" title="查看运行中的容器："></a>查看运行中的容器：</h5><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">docker</span> <span class="token function">ps</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><h5 id="查看本地镜像："><a href="#查看本地镜像：" class="headerlink" title="查看本地镜像："></a>查看本地镜像：</h5><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">docker</span> images<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><h5 id="查看所有容器："><a href="#查看所有容器：" class="headerlink" title="查看所有容器："></a>查看所有容器：</h5><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">docker</span> <span class="token function">ps</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-a</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><h5 id="停止容器："><a href="#停止容器：" class="headerlink" title="停止容器："></a>停止容器：</h5><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">docker</span> stop my_container<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><h5 id="启动容器："><a href="#启动容器：" class="headerlink" title="启动容器："></a>启动容器：</h5><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">docker</span> start my_container<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><h5 id="删除容器："><a href="#删除容器：" class="headerlink" title="删除容器："></a>删除容器：</h5><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">docker</span> <span class="token function">rm</span> my_container<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><h5 id="删除镜像："><a href="#删除镜像：" class="headerlink" title="删除镜像："></a>删除镜像：</h5><pre class="line-numbers language-none"><code class="language-none">docker rmi my_custom_image<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><h2 id="代码与容器"><a href="#代码与容器" class="headerlink" title="代码与容器"></a>代码与容器</h2><h4 id="将代码放在容器中"><a href="#将代码放在容器中" class="headerlink" title="将代码放在容器中"></a>将代码放在容器中</h4><p>复制代码到容器：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">docker</span> <span class="token function">cp</span> /path/to/your/code my_container:/app<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><p>运行代码：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token builtin class-name">cd</span> /apppython3 your_script.py<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><h4 id="挂载实现同步代码"><a href="#挂载实现同步代码" class="headerlink" title="挂载实现同步代码"></a>挂载实现同步代码</h4><p>运行容器并挂载：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">docker</span> run <span class="token parameter variable">-it</span> <span class="token parameter variable">--name</span> my_container <span class="token parameter variable">-v</span> /path/to/your/code:/app your_image<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><h2 id="Docker-Hub"><a href="#Docker-Hub" class="headerlink" title="Docker Hub"></a>Docker Hub</h2><p>登录hub：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">docker</span> login<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><p>为镜像打标签：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-none"><code class="language-none">&lt;dockerhub用户名&gt;/&lt;镜像名&gt;:&lt;标签&gt;<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">docker</span> tag my_custom_image myusername/my_custom_image:v1.0<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><p>推送：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">docker</span> push myusername/my_custom_image:v1.0<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><p>拉取：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-none"><code class="language-none">docker pull myusername/my_custom_image:v1.0<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre>]]></content>
      
      
