            <tag> Hexo </tag>
            
            <tag> Blog </tag>
            
        </tags>
      
    </entry>
    
    
    
    <entry>
      <title>建设自己的博客 —— Hexo部署使用</title>
      <link href="/2025/11/03/build-blog/"/>
      <url>/2025/11/03/build-blog/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="系统"><a href="#系统" class="headerlink" title="系统"></a>系统</h2><p>Ubuntu22.04</p><h2 id="前置安装"><a href="#前置安装" class="headerlink" title="前置安装"></a>前置安装</h2><h3 id="nodejs"><a href="#nodejs" class="headerlink" title="nodejs"></a>nodejs</h3><p><strong>不要</strong>直接使用</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">apt</span> <span class="token function">install</span> nodejs<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><p>这样的不是最新版本</p><h4 id="通过NodeSource-PPA安装"><a href="#通过NodeSource-PPA安装" class="headerlink" title="通过NodeSource PPA安装"></a>通过NodeSource PPA安装</h4><p>参考：<a href="https://github.com/nodesource/distributions/blob/master/DEV_README.md">https://github.com/nodesource/distributions/blob/master/DEV_README.md</a></p><h4 id="PS：从官网也可，不过麻烦一些"><a href="#PS：从官网也可，不过麻烦一些" class="headerlink" title="PS：从官网也可，不过麻烦一些"></a>PS：从官网也可，不过麻烦一些</h4><p>官方地址：<a href="https://nodejs.org/en/download">https://nodejs.org/en/download</a></p><h2 id="Hexo安装"><a href="#Hexo安装" class="headerlink" title="Hexo安装"></a>Hexo安装</h2><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash">$ <span class="token function">npm</span> <span class="token function">install</span> hexo-cli <span class="token parameter variable">-g</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><p>安装后使用</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash">hexo <span class="token parameter variable">-V</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><p>可查看版本</p><h3 id="问题一：npm-install-安装不了，提示权限不够"><a href="#问题一：npm-install-安装不了，提示权限不够" class="headerlink" title="问题一：npm install 安装不了，提示权限不够"></a>问题一：npm install 安装不了，提示权限不够</h3><p>参考：<a href="https://sven-chr.github.io/myblog/2025/10/14/2025-10-14-npm-permission-solution-guide/">https://sven-chr.github.io/myblog/2025/10/14/2025-10-14-npm-permission-solution-guide/</a></p><ol><li><p>创建新的全局包目录</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">mkdir</span> ~/.npm-global<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre></li><li><p>配置npm使用新目录</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">npm</span> config <span class="token builtin class-name">set</span> prefix <span class="token string">'~/.npm-global'</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre></li><li><p>更新path</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> <span class="token string">'export PATH=~/.npm-global/bin:$PATH'</span> <span class="token operator">&gt;&gt;</span> ~/.bashrc<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre></li><li><p>重新加载</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token builtin class-name">source</span> ~/.bashrc<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre></li></ol><h3 id="问题二：hexo-Command-Can‘t-Found"><a href="#问题二：hexo-Command-Can‘t-Found" class="headerlink" title="问题二：hexo Command Can‘t Found"></a>问题二：hexo Command Can‘t Found</h3><p>如果出现找不到该命令，那是因为Hexo的问题，需使用npx hexo。</p><p>但为了省事，需要在~/.bashrc中添加</p><pre class="line-numbers language-none"><code class="language-none">export PATH=$PATH:~/.npm-global/bin<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><h2 id="初始化Hexo文件项目"><a href="#初始化Hexo文件项目" class="headerlink" title="初始化Hexo文件项目"></a>初始化Hexo文件项目</h2><ol><li><p>可事先创建文件夹dir，也可不创建</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash">hexo init <span class="token operator">&lt;</span>dir<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre></li><li><p>安装所需npm套件</p><pre class="line-numbers language-none"><code class="language-none">npm install<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre></li></ol><h2 id="部署到Github"><a href="#部署到Github" class="headerlink" title="部署到Github"></a>部署到Github</h2><h3 id="新建一个github项目"><a href="#新建一个github项目" class="headerlink" title="新建一个github项目"></a>新建一个github项目</h3><p><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/Sunshinesheep/blogpic@main/img/image-20251103205032507.png"></p><p>注意命名，需要为username.github.io</p><h3 id="上传Hexo项目"><a href="#上传Hexo项目" class="headerlink" title="上传Hexo项目"></a>上传Hexo项目</h3><h4 id="安装git相关组件"><a href="#安装git相关组件" class="headerlink" title="安装git相关组件"></a>安装git相关组件</h4><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">npm</span> <span class="token function">install</span> hexo-deployer-git <span class="token parameter variable">--save</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><h4 id="修改根目录-config-yml"><a href="#修改根目录-config-yml" class="headerlink" title="修改根目录_config.yml"></a>修改根目录_config.yml</h4><pre class="line-numbers language-none"><code class="language-none">deploy:  type: git  repo: https://github.com/username/username.github.io.git  branch: main<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><h4 id="部署"><a href="#部署" class="headerlink" title="部署"></a>部署</h4><pre class="line-numbers language-none"><code class="language-none">hexo deploy<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre>]]></content>
      
      
      <categories>
          
          <category> 经验分享 </category>
          
      </categories>
      
      
        <tags>
            
            <tag> Hexo </tag>
            
            <tag> Blog </tag>
            
        </tags>
      
    </entry>
    
    
    
    <entry>
      <title>Ubuntu 装机必备</title>
      <link href="/2025/11/03/Ubuntu-start/"/>
      <url>/2025/11/03/Ubuntu-start/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>从最初的系统开始</p><h3 id="安装基本软件包"><a href="#安装基本软件包" class="headerlink" title="安装基本软件包"></a>安装基本软件包</h3><h4 id="安装GCC、Make"><a href="#安装GCC、Make" class="headerlink" title="安装GCC、Make"></a>安装GCC、Make</h4><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">sudo</span> <span class="token function">apt</span> update<span class="token function">sudo</span> <span class="token function">apt</span> <span class="token function">install</span> build-essential<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><h4 id="安装Git"><a href="#安装Git" class="headerlink" title="安装Git"></a>安装Git</h4><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">sudo</span> <span class="token function">apt</span> insatll <span class="token function">git</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><h4 id="安装curl"><a href="#安装curl" class="headerlink" title="安装curl"></a>安装curl</h4><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">sudo</span> <span class="token function">apt</span> <span class="token function">install</span> <span class="token function">curl</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><h3 id="安装魔法"><a href="#安装魔法" class="headerlink" title="安装魔法"></a>安装魔法</h3><p>此处省略</p><h3 id="Minicoda安装"><a href="#Minicoda安装" class="headerlink" title="Minicoda安装"></a>Minicoda安装</h3><p>USTC mirror提供miniconda安装包</p><p>下载后：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">bash</span> Miniconda3-latest-Linux-x86_64.sh<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><p>更新conda源</p><pre class="line-numbers language-none"><code class="language-none">channels:  - nodefaultscustom_channels:  conda-forge: https://mirrors.ustc.edu.cn/anaconda/cloud  bioconda: https://mirrors.ustc.edu.cn/anaconda/cloudshow_channel_urls: true<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><h3 id="Docker、Docker-compose以及NVIDIA-Container-Toolkit安装"><a href="#Docker、Docker-compose以及NVIDIA-Container-Toolkit安装" class="headerlink" title="Docker、Docker-compose以及NVIDIA Container Toolkit安装"></a>Docker、Docker-compose以及NVIDIA Container Toolkit安装</h3><h4 id="Docker"><a href="#Docker" class="headerlink" title="Docker"></a>Docker</h4><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">sudo</span> <span class="token function">apt-get</span> <span class="token function">install</span> docker.io<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><p>记得修改镜像源，文件位于/etc/docker/daemon.json</p><h4 id="Docker-compose"><a href="#Docker-compose" class="headerlink" title="Docker-compose"></a>Docker-compose</h4><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">sudo</span> <span class="token function">apt</span> <span class="token function">install</span> <span class="token function">docker-compose</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><h4 id="NVIDIA-Container-Toolkit"><a href="#NVIDIA-Container-Toolkit" class="headerlink" title="NVIDIA Container Toolkit"></a>NVIDIA Container Toolkit</h4><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">curl</span> https://get.docker.com <span class="token operator">|</span> <span class="token function">sh</span> <span class="token punctuation">\</span><span class="token operator">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class="token function">sudo</span> systemctl <span class="token parameter variable">--now</span> <span class="token builtin class-name">enable</span> <span class="token function">docker</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token assign-left variable">distribution</span><span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token variable"><span class="token variable">$(</span><span class="token builtin class-name">.</span> /etc/os-release<span class="token punctuation">;</span><span class="token builtin class-name">echo</span> $ID$VERSION_ID<span class="token variable">)</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">curl</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-fsSL</span> https://nvidia.github.io/libnvidia-container/gpgkey <span class="token operator">|</span> <span class="token function">sudo</span> gpg <span class="token parameter variable">--dearmor</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-o</span> /usr/share/keyrings/nvidia-container-toolkit-keyring.gpg <span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">curl</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-s</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-L</span> https://nvidia.github.io/libnvidia-container/<span class="token variable">$distribution</span>/libnvidia-container.list <span class="token operator">|</span> <span class="token punctuation">\</span>          <span class="token function">sed</span> <span class="token string">'s#deb https://#deb [signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/nvidia-container-toolkit-keyring.gpg] https://#g'</span> <span class="token operator">|</span> <span class="token punctuation">\</span>          <span class="token function">sudo</span> <span class="token function">tee</span> /etc/apt/sources.list.d/nvidia-container-toolkit.list<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">sudo</span> <span class="token function">apt-get</span> update<span class="token function">sudo</span> <span class="token function">apt-get</span> <span class="token function">install</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-y</span> nvidia-docker2<span class="token function">sudo</span> systemctl restart <span class="token function">docker</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>再修改daemon.json，增加以下内容：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-none"><code class="language-none">"default-runtime": "nvidia","runtimes": {  "nvidia": {    "path": "nvidia-container-runtime",    "runtimeArgs": []  }}<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>重启docker后，验证：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">docker</span> run <span class="token parameter variable">--rm</span> <span class="token parameter variable">--gpus</span> all nvidia/cuda:12.9.1-base-ubuntu20.04 nvidia-smi<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre>]]></content>
      
      
